cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "reader-ergonomics-project (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  How one person prepares and runs a project, from a problem to its result, with the fewest round trips: scope, review, baseline, plan, execution, refinement, each step a topic; and the folder a job leaves behind. Scope only; the review is not started.
type: software
